              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mary Siever"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a must recipe for our family every year. This year I didn't do all of the baking I normally do, but I had to make this one at the request of all my children. If you follow the recipe properly it works great. And you have to keep it refrigerated. If it didn't work, you didn't do it right. We have been making it for several years. You can make it healthy by using natural peanut butter and sugar free chocolate (or low sugar chocolate) and it still tastes great.",
            "datePublished": "2014-01-05T19:00:25.197Z"
          },
