              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Euphie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I just made it for a bake sale on short notice, it tastes amazing! Just like reeses cups, I used milk chocolate chips instead of semisweet ones and topped it with walnuts. It's easy to follow, quick, and delicious.",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-02T23:10:25.880Z"
          },
          {
