            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mermaid"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family really enjoyed eating this and my grandchildren loved helping me make it. So easy. Be sure to refrigerate after making. It sets up beautifully. For a bit different mix, use the peanut butter chocolate chips instead of the plain chocolate chip kind. Everyone liked this. It made quite a bit. Not super, sicky sweet either like alot of fudge recipes are. You can't go wrong with the recipe.",
